# Rules for AI assistants working in this repo

The rules live in AGENTS.md: the five hardware safety interlocks, the rules that
cause bugs when missed, and a "Where to look" list naming the docs/*.md file to
read before each kind of change. Read AGENTS.md before changing anything.

This repo is the live Home Assistant config: saved edits take effect at once.

This file only points at AGENTS.md. Don't copy rules here; keep each rule in one place.
